@startuml
title Revisi Sequence Diagram — Delegasi Pemesanan Villa
autonumber
actor Pengunjung
boundary "Next.js Detail Villa\nAvailabilityCalendar" as Next
control "URL builder\nlib/lodgify/booking" as Builder
entity "Lodgify Checkout\nexternal domain" as Checkout
entity WhatsApp

Pengunjung -> Next : Pilih tanggal dan jumlah tamu
Next -> Next : Validasi availability, min stay, tamu
alt data booking tidak valid
  Next --> Pengunjung : Tampilkan pesan validasi/fallback WhatsApp
else pilih Lodgify Checkout
  Next -> Builder : buildLodgifyCheckoutUrl(propertyId, dates, guests)
  Builder --> Next : URL checkout.lodgify.com
  Next -> Checkout : Browser redirect (window.location.href)
  Checkout --> Pengunjung : Proses checkout eksternal
else pilih WhatsApp
  Next -> Builder : buildBookingWhatsAppUrl(villa, dates, guests)
  Builder --> Next : URL wa.me dengan pesan
  Next -> WhatsApp : Buka tautan eksternal
  WhatsApp --> Pengunjung : Lanjutkan komunikasi booking
end
note over Next,Checkout
Tidak ada POST booking ke Laravel, controller/model Booking,
atau tabel booking MySQL pada source code.
end note
@enduml
